  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of differences between outcomes and a reference value (zero in this case), and a comparison of the expected differences (weighted by probabilities). The individual did not consider the reference value or compute or compare expected differences. Instead, the individual focused only on the maximum potential gain in Lottery A, ignoring probabilities and the expected value. The justification is not aligned with the rule of the decision reason, which involves evaluating expected differences from a reference. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The reasoning is inconsistent with the required components of the reason (reference value, differences, weighted comparison).",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
